This repository contains build scripts and configuration fragments for a
Linux kernel derived from Android GKI / EVONIX.

The Linux kernel is licensed under the GNU General Public License v2.
See https://www.kernel.org/doc/html/latest/process/license-rules.html

Scripts in this repository that are original to ROOTURK are provided
under GPL-2.0-only, the same terms as the kernel they configure.

Upstream:
  https://github.com/NEESCHAL-3/EVONIX-Kernel
